### 3C. Save Foodics Refresh Token (PASTE NEW REFRESH TOKEN HERE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Admin/tenantcredentials/{{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "systemType": "FoodicsRefreshToken",
  "apiKey": ""
}

### 3D. Save WooCommerce Webhook Secret
POST {{baseUrl}}/Admin/tenantcredentials/{{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "systemType": "WooCommerceWebhookSecret",
  "apiKey": "{{webhookKey}}" 
}

### Generate Fresh Foodics Token
POST https://api-sandbox.foodics.com/v5/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "9d949103-d90b-4d0e-99ea-28d298f3d10c",
  "client_secret": "m70D5N48x47IPWfX7twIrw4BkKHV1StkV4eD3aoY",
  "grant_type": "client_credentials"
}


